---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const infos = [
  { k: 'Where', v: "Moroccan Sahara, near M'Hamid el Ghizlane" },
  { k: 'When', v: '10 – 21 December 2026' },
  { k: 'Format', v: '12 days, cross-disciplinary, in English' },
  { k: 'Group', v: 'Up to 14 participants' },
  { k: 'Early bird', v: 'Until 10 October' },
  { k: 'Scholarships', v: 'Available on request' },
];
---
<Base title="Desert Mirage Journey — Anys Mechkar">
  <section class="page-hero" style="min-height:64vh;"><img src="/img/hero-desert-mirage.jpg" alt="" />
    <div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Résidence artistique · Sahara</p><h1 style="font-size:clamp(2.2rem,5.5vw,3.6rem);">Desert Mirage Journey</h1><p class="lead" style="margin-top:1rem;">An international cross-disciplinary artist residency in the Moroccan Sahara.</p></div>
  </section>

  <section class="passage">
    <div class="narrow"><p>間 Ma, the space in between. The interval where something can breathe and take form.</p></div>
  </section>

  <section class="breath" style="min-height:52vh;"><img src="/img/u-immersion.jpg" alt="" /><div class="phrase">Something rare happens when you let the desert meet you.</div></section>

  <section style="padding:0;">
    <div class="univers">
      <div class="univers__img"><img src="/img/breath-desert.jpg" alt="" /></div>
      <div class="univers__body">
        <p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:0.6rem;">The journey</p>
        <h2>Twelve days in the desert</h2>
        <p>Over twelve days we live nomadically in the desert, meeting its immensity and our own, immersed in a nomadic culture that carries ancestral wisdom. The residency is led by Yi Chen and Anys, who have guided initiatic desert journeys over several years, now opened to cross-disciplinary co-creation.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="univers rev">
      <div class="univers__img"><img src="/img/hero-quintessence.jpg" alt="" /></div>
      <div class="univers__body">
        <p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:0.6rem;">Who it's for</p>
        <h2>Every medium welcome</h2>
        <p>Whether you arrive with a project, a question, or simply a creative impulse, you are welcome. Dancers, performers, musicians, visual artists, writers and seekers have all found their place here.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bloc-or">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Good to know</p>
      <h2 style="margin-top:0.8rem;">The essentials</h2>
      <div class="infos" style="margin-top:1.8rem;">{infos.map((it) => <div><div class="k">{it.k}</div><div class="v">{it.v}</div></div>)}</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="striptease">
    <div class="photo-slot">Photo à venir</div>
    <div class="photo-slot">Photo à venir</div>
    <div class="photo-slot">Photo à venir</div>
  </section>

  <section class="breath" style="min-height:40vh;">
    <img src="/img/hero-desert-mirage.jpg" alt="" />
    <div class="phrase" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:1.6rem;">
      Ready to apply ?
      <a class="btn" href="https://desertmiragejourney.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="font-style:normal;">desertmiragejourney.com</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
